# Build context for every docker/images/*.Dockerfile is docker/ itself. The
# images COPY exactly the in-container tooling; everything else here runs on the
# host, so the context is an allowlist rather than a denylist.
#
# Nothing general-purpose is baked anymore. The activate hook, the fetch/dataset
# tooling (ptdbench_fetch.py, ptdbench_dataset.py, ptdbench_datasets/) and
# install-ptdbench-tooling.sh are all provisioned at prepare time from the repo
# (the hook via prepared/ptdbench-activate.sh; the tooling via
# install-ptdbench-tooling.sh), not COPY'd, so they stay out of the build context.
*
# agent-r1-alfworld.Dockerfile installs its pinned stack from this runtime dir.
!agent-r1-runtime
!agent-r1-runtime/**
!verl-moe-token/mcore5047-minimal.patch
**/__pycache__
